---
const steps = [
  {
    num: 'I',
    title: 'Install',
    time: 'two minutes',
    body: 'Download the build for your machine and open it. The builds are not code-signed yet, so the OS pauses once: Windows shows "More info, Run anyway", macOS wants a trip through Privacy & Security, and a Linux AppImage needs a chmod +x.',
    link: { href: '/install', text: 'Per-platform steps' },
  },
  {
    num: 'II',
    title: 'Pick a mind',
    time: 'one minute',
    body: 'On first launch the settings window opens by itself on the AI tab. Paste an API key, or point it at Ollama for a free local model (a running Ollama is picked up automatically), or choose the Claude Code or Codex CLI you already log into. Save.',
    link: { href: '#providers', text: 'Every provider it speaks' },
  },
  {
    num: 'III',
    title: 'Say it',
    time: 'one sentence',
    body: 'Click Chat in the sidebar and type what you want: "a countdown to tonight\'s sunset for Seattle, with the sun sliding down as it goes." A window appears. Close the chat; the window stays and keeps refreshing. Every window\'s ? button shows what it can do and lets you ask it anything.',
    link: { href: '#examples', text: 'More things to ask for' },
  },
  {
    num: 'IV',
    title: 'Let it reach out',
    time: 'when you say so',
    body: 'The first time an abject wants to run a shell command, read a file outside its sandbox, or browse somewhere new, a permission prompt appears and waits for your yes. Grant once, or set standing rules in Settings. Nothing touches your machine without a receipt.',
    link: { href: '#faq', text: 'How the containment works' },
  },
];
---

<section id="first-abject" class="first-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Download to First Abject in Five Minutes</h2>
    <p class="first-subtitle">
      What actually happens between clicking Download and having a running object that is yours.
    </p>

    <ol class="first-steps">
      {steps.map((s) => (
        <li class="first-step card">
          <div class="first-step-head">
            <span class="first-num">{s.num}</span>
            <h3>{s.title}</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="first-time">{s.time}</span>
          <p>{s.body}</p>
          <a class="first-link" href={s.link.href}>{s.link.text} &rarr;</a>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>

    <div class="first-try">
      <p class="first-try-label">Things to say first, copied from real sessions:</p>
      <ul class="first-try-list">
        <li>"When is low tide in Seattle tomorrow?"</li>
        <li>"Show me the Sun, the Earth, and the Moon, live, and keep it fresh."</li>
        <li>"Make a fish tank. The fish should get hungry."</li>
        <li>"Ask the tide widget what it can do."</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .first-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: -1.5rem auto 2.5rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .first-steps {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    counter-reset: none;
  }

  .first-step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .first-step-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .first-step-head h3 {
    margin: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .first-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--void-purple);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .first-time {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: -0.25rem;
  }

  .first-step p {
    flex: 1;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .first-link {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--eldritch-dim);
  }

  .first-link:hover {
    color: var(--eldritch);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .first-try {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 2.5rem auto 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .first-try-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .first-try-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .first-try-list li {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--eldritch);
  }

  .first-try-list li::before {
    content: 'you> ';
    color: var(--void-purple);
  }
</style>
